        "after": {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "にかけて",
          "rationale": "不正解。「にかけて」は「任される」の対象を示す助詞として使えない。"
        },
        "reason": "The original にこそ allows a grammatical emphatic recipient reading; こそ is not restricted to positive focus."
